{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39618","headline":"喜翁文尧员外病起 · 黄滔","name":"喜翁文尧员外病起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卫玠羊车悬，长卿驷马姿。\n天嫌太端正，神乃减风仪。\n饮冰俾消渴，断谷皆清羸。\n越僧夸艾炷，秦女隔花枝。\n自能论苦器，不假求良医。\n惊杀漳滨鬼，错与刘生随。\n昨日已如虎，今朝谒荀池。\n扬鞭入王门，四面人熙熙。\n青桂任霜霰，尺璧无瑕疵。\n回尘却惆怅，归阙难迟迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39618.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39618","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}